OL,3,GNEWSACriticism after AI music used in
OL,4,AUK's oldest carnival
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe use of artificial intelligence (AI)
OL,7,Fin music during the UK's oldest
OL,8,Fcarnival is "disappointing", a carnival
OL,9,Fmember has said.
OL,11,FAbout 150,000 people descended on
OL,12,FBridgwater, Somerset, to watch the
OL,13,Fprocession of illuminated carts, which
OL,14,Fshowcase local creativity and talent.
OL,16,FSpeaking after Saturday's event,
OL,17,Fcarnival member Matt Ward said it was
OL,18,Fdisappointing that some of the 50 carts
OL,19,Fused AI music, adding: "We're kind of
OL,20,Fforgetting where carnival came from."
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
