OL,3,GNEWSACriticism after AI music used in
OL,4,AUK's oldest carnival
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrganisers of the Bridgwater Guy Fawkes
OL,7,FCarnival said they appreciated
OL,8,FAI-generated music "divided opinions",
OL,9,Fbut it is the individual clubs'
OL,10,Fdecision, adding that carnival has
OL,11,F"always embraced new technology".
